@startuml
actor Patient
participant PatientApp as App
participant Backend
participant Database

Patient -> App : Select file to upload
App -> Backend : POST /api/patients/{id}/documents (multipart)
Backend -> Database : Insert PatientDocument metadata
Database --> Backend : Persisted record
Backend -> App : 201 Created + document ID

App -> Backend : GET /api/patients/{id}/documents/{docId}
Backend -> Database : Authorise and read metadata
Database --> Backend : Document metadata
Backend --> App : 200 OK + file stream or signed URL
@enduml

